      "content": "i know you're saying i should check with them, but my doctor is super busy and i can't get an appointment for like two weeks. i really want to get these bones stronger and i feel fine right now. like, can't i just take them at different times of the day so they don't touch? or maybe just take the vitamin in the evening and the warfarin in the morning? it seems like a simple fix.",
