      "content": "i get that, but i'm really hesitant about the pharmacist because they always just tell me like a million things. it's just one little supplement, right? vitamin k is practically a natural thing, not like a heavy drug. if i just stick to a small dose, like half a pill instead of the full thing, is that probably safe enough to just keep going until i see my doctor? i just don't want to miss out on the bone benefits while waiting around.",
